# Sun Orb (items.md Ammo, 100 sun cells): fullbright sun sphere, white-hot towards the top-left, on a
# gold cradle; 2-frame shimmer (18 tics each): the hot spot moves and the corona sparks change place.
# Composed from a circle and a hot-spot falloff, then pixel-corrected by hand.
# Frame 1 of 2.
# Some _00 pixels at inner corners are drawn by hand: they keep the outline colour
# of the art to their left, where tools/items.py would take the colour of the art above.
name orb_idle_d0_f1
size 20 20
= @ fb_amber
= % fb_gold
= & fb_orange
= * fb_sun
= + fb_yellow
= a gold_02
= b gold_04
= c gold_06
= d gold_08
= e gold_10
outline fb_amber orange_00
outline fb_gold gold_00
outline fb_orange orange_00
= 7 gold_00
grid
